## Keeps the BigWigsMods/packager GitHub Action (.github/workflows/release.yml)
## in sync with the dev-file excludes that workflow already applies to the
## GitHub release zip -- see that workflow's rsync --exclude list, which this
## mirrors.
ignore:
  - .github
  - .claude
  - .vscode
  - .idea
  - .gitignore
  - .luacheckrc
  - .busted
  - docs
  - spec
  - scripts
  - "*.gs"
  - "*.md"

## release_notes.md is generated by release.yml's "Extract changelog section
## for this release" step (the same CHANGELOG.md excerpt used as the GitHub
## Release body) before the packager step runs, so the CurseForge changelog
## matches the GitHub Release word for word instead of the packager's default
## auto-generated git-log changelog. Still excluded from the shipped addon
## zip by the "*.md" ignore glob above -- that only controls package
## contents, not where the packager reads the changelog text from.
manual-changelog:
  filename: release_notes.md
  markup-type: markdown
